00:17:10,120 --> 00:17:10,950
Ronco.

257
00:17:11,080 --> 00:17:14,657
You know, we almost drowned, got
killed, we even had to grovel.

258
00:17:14,740 --> 00:17:18,180
I got through all of that
because you were there, Ronko.

259
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:22,340
If you leave oinky-doink,
I'll definitely be sad.

260
00:17:22,940 --> 00:17:25,300
But please, don't worry about me.

261
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:27,661
Even when the time finally comes,

262
00:17:27,820 --> 00:17:30,397
I'll start practicing
for your graduation so

263
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:33,197
you can leave with a
proper smile on your face.

264
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:35,680
I promise I won't get emotional.

265
00:17:38,060 --> 00:17:40,413
But it looks like you're already crying.

266
00:17:40,560 --> 00:17:42,620
No, that's not what's happening.

267
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,647
I have you to thank, Nagomi.

268
00:17:45,340 --> 00:17:46,170
What?

269
00:17:47,280 --> 00:17:48,640
If it weren't for you,

270
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:52,802
I never would have considered what
normal happiness might be like.

271
00:17:55,860 --> 00:17:57,020
I'm leaving now.

272
00:17:57,840 --> 00:17:58,670
Ronco?

273
00:18:05,740 --> 00:18:06,677
Listen, Nogomi.

274
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:09,348
Please take care of
Oinky Doink Cafe for me.

275
00:18:35,060 --> 00:18:37,360
I've decided to settle this my own way.

276
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:56,640
Oh, I'm sorry.

277
00:18:56,820 --> 00:18:58,117
I seem to have made a mistake.

278
00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:59,220
Hey, hold on.

279
00:18:59,600 --> 00:19:01,880
We're trying to pick her up. No, no.

280
00:19:21,180 --> 00:19:22,640
Was that an accident?

281
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:24,313
That didn't sound good.

282
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:40,440
Who are you?

283
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:42,340
I'm a panda.

284
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:46,697
That's great, frickin' Panda!

285
00:19:46,780 --> 00:19:50,780
I can't let Ronco live with the
burden of having to kill her master?

286
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:04,660
Why don't we have a nice little chat?

287
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:37,480
Is this your idea of making amends?

288
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:40,976
So you're back to being silent again.

289
00:20:41,560 --> 00:20:43,325
Can I just tell you one thing?

290
00:20:44,600 --> 00:20:45,659
Fifteen years ago,

291
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:50,640
the one who had me kill Miss Michio was
the current head of Creatureland, Nagi.

292
00:20:51,540 --> 00:20:54,364
She's the one who gave
the order this time, too.

293
00:20:54,560 --> 00:20:56,384
So that's how it's going to be.

294
00:21:32,240 --> 00:21:35,800
There's a lot of people around the world.

295
00:21:39,520 --> 00:21:43,137
That's my life!

296
00:21:43,220 --> 00:21:48,157
I don't know if you're a fool?

297
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:51,240
I see the blood.

298
00:21:57,140 --> 00:21:59,940
Thank you.

299
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:49,977
I'm not going to kill Ronco Manon.

300
00:22:50,060 --> 00:22:55,000
I thought I told you that crushing Oinky
Doink Cafe is what the group decided.

301
00:22:55,740 --> 00:23:00,160
Refusing to kill her means defying
the entire Creatureland group.

302
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:02,200
Interpret it as you wish.

303
00:23:02,380 --> 00:23:03,640
This is my mess.

304
00:23:03,800 --> 00:23:06,120
I've decided to settle it my own way.

305
00:23:06,260 --> 00:23:08,620
You'll cast your life before swine?

306
00:23:08,800 --> 00:23:10,337
You have questionable taste.

307
00:23:10,420 --> 00:23:13,361
I don't need you to
understand Miss Ronko's value.
